The film stars Joseph Gordon-Levitt and Zooey Deschanel as Tom and Summer respectively, and in a
nonlinear narrative structure, Tom chronicles the story of his relationship with Summer.

14
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
As an independent production, the film was picked up for distribution by Fox
Searchlight Pictures and premiered at the 25th Sundance Film Festival.

15
01:07:51,428 --> 01:07:57,428
