$60.7 million in worldwide returns, far exceeding its $7.5 million budget.

16
01:12:22,857 --> 01:12:28,857
Many critics lauded the film as one of the best from 2009 and drew comparisons to
other acclaimed films such as Annie Hall (1977) and High Fidelity (2000).

17
